        "TileImage": "$($repository 1289b7a5-4639-45b4-a889-fa4f66078414).Image",
        "Description": "Hello Puchacz1993, I know you&apos;ll at least play this contract, and for that reason I want to ask you some questions. You have somehow managed to play nearly every contract I have ever published, even the ones I never shared elsewhere online.\r\rThis has fascinated me for years. How do you play so many contracts? How do you do them all Silent Assassin?\r\rSorry if this is hard to understand, I suspect your first language is Polish.\r\rFind me online as &quot;Cartwheel76,&quot; so I can ask you these questions.",
